# NOTE: site/public/wheels/ is intentionally tracked, not ignored — Vercel's
# build only runs `next build`, it can't regenerate these via
# tools/build_browser_wheels.sh, so the demo needs them committed as static
# assets. Rebuild + recommit with `make browser-wheels` when deps change.
